    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Well, at least the person who put up these posters got the locations right.
    Actually, no\u2014they didn\u2019t! Who puts up posters at such an angle? All
    these damn posters are either crooked or hanging in the wrong place."
