  m_Text: "Alright, I checked, and it looks like you\u2019re right\u2014this thing
    is everywhere, and the company is behind it. I also found what you were looking
    for. It\u2019s an old military device designed to disable electronics. It\u2019s
    in a bunker outside of town."
